    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>In Development!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Core is currently in development, and we are working hard to deliver the best possible gameplay experience. We are continuously refining combat mechanics, enemy designs, and progression systems to create the most engaging action-packed journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Fight, Die, Evolve, and Repeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Core is a roguelite action game featuring uncharted planetary exploration and fast-paced, fluid combat. Death is inevitable, but not the end\u2014unleash the power of the Core in your new body and continue the fight. As you venture deeper into the unknown, each new planet brings you closer to a greater truth\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/gif-gameplay800?t=1755636804\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die and Grow Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defeat is just the beginning. Face relentless enemies, fall in battle, and rise again with permanent upgrades that make you stronger for your next expedition. Adapt, improve, and push further with every cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/2c9a04b8f369945605ca5d10bd3d8020.poster.avif?t=1755636804\" width=660 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/2c9a04b8f369945605ca5d10bd3d8020.webm?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/2c9a04b8f369945605ca5d10bd3d8020.mp4?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Planets, Wield the Power Bestowed Upon You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across diverse planets, each with unique biomes and hostile creatures standing in your way. Guided by the System and the power it grants you, eliminate all opposition and uncover the secrets hidden within each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/d18fad14fb86a731fec195cddedfebac.poster.avif?t=1755636804\" width=592 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/d18fad14fb86a731fec195cddedfebac.webm?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/d18fad14fb86a731fec195cddedfebac.mp4?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Unique and Powerful Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every reward, choose from a variety of enhancements that shape your playstyle. Experiment with different builds and abilities, ensuring that no two runs ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/38be916cae625f4c1a146310c2419661.poster.avif?t=1755636804\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/38be916cae625f4c1a146310c2419661.webm?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/38be916cae625f4c1a146310c2419661.mp4?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>In Development!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Core is currently in development, and we are working hard to deliver the best possible gameplay experience. We are continuously refining combat mechanics, enemy designs, and progression systems to create the most engaging action-packed journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Fight, Die, Evolve, and Repeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Core is a roguelite action game featuring uncharted planetary exploration and fast-paced, fluid combat. Death is inevitable, but not the end\u2014unleash the power of the Core in your new body and continue the fight. As you venture deeper into the unknown, each new planet brings you closer to a greater truth\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/gif-gameplay800?t=1755636804\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die and Grow Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defeat is just the beginning. Face relentless enemies, fall in battle, and rise again with permanent upgrades that make you stronger for your next expedition. Adapt, improve, and push further with every cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/2c9a04b8f369945605ca5d10bd3d8020.poster.avif?t=1755636804\" width=660 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/2c9a04b8f369945605ca5d10bd3d8020.webm?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/2c9a04b8f369945605ca5d10bd3d8020.mp4?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Planets, Wield the Power Bestowed Upon You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across diverse planets, each with unique biomes and hostile creatures standing in your way. Guided by the System and the power it grants you, eliminate all opposition and uncover the secrets hidden within each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/d18fad14fb86a731fec195cddedfebac.poster.avif?t=1755636804\" width=592 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/d18fad14fb86a731fec195cddedfebac.webm?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/d18fad14fb86a731fec195cddedfebac.mp4?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Unique and Powerful Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every reward, choose from a variety of enhancements that shape your playstyle. Experiment with different builds and abilities, ensuring that no two runs ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/38be916cae625f4c1a146310c2419661.poster.avif?t=1755636804\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/38be916cae625f4c1a146310c2419661.webm?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575040/extras/38be916cae625f4c1a146310c2419661.mp4?t=1755636804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
